[{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is inversely proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. State which of the following diagrams could represent the graph of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> against <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p><strong>A</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>B</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>C</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>D</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.17/questions/assets/graph-A.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></td><td><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.17/questions/assets/graph-B.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></td><td><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.17/questions/assets/graph-C.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></td><td><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.17/questions/assets/graph-D.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></td></tr></table></div>","steps":["<p>A appears to be a quadratic curve, so this would not represent <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1{x^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>B appears to be a cubic curve, so this would not represent <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1{x^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>C appears to be a reciprocal curve, and could represent <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1{x^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>D also appears to be a reciprocal curve, but would fit <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1{x^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and not <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1{x^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>In each of these cases, write down an equation for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant of proportionality:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is directly proportional to the square of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is inversely proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is directly proportional to the cube root of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is inversely proportional to the cube of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto x^2\\Rightarrow y=kx^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1x\\Rightarrow y=\\frac{k}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto x^{\\frac13}\\Rightarrow y=kx^{\\frac13}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\\propto\\frac1{(x+1)^3}\\Rightarrow y=\\frac{k}{(x+1)^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is directly proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=100\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny\\propto x^2 \\Rightarrow y=kx^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n100=k\\times5^2 \\Rightarrow k=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore y =4x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny =4\\times10^2=400\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is inversely proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt[4]{x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=81\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=18\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=180\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny\\propto\\frac1{x^{\\frac14}} \\Rightarrow y=\\frac{k}{x^{\\frac14}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n18=\\frac{k}{81^{\\frac14}} \\Rightarrow k=54\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore y =\\frac{54}{x^{\\frac14}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n180=\\frac{54}{x^{\\frac14}} \\Rightarrow x^{\\frac14}=\\frac3{10}\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{81}{10000}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>The volume of gas, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V\" data-display=\"false\"></span> litres, that a gas canister can hold is directly proportional to the temperature, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> Kelvin. It is given that when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=300\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V=24\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine the volume of gas when the temperature is 400 Kelvin.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nV\\propto T \\Rightarrow V=kT\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n24=k\\times300 \\Rightarrow k=\\frac2{25}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore V =\\frac2{25}T\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nV =\\frac2{25}\\times400=32\\text{ litres}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The time taken, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hours, to complete a job is inversely proportional to the number of workers, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, employed. It is given that when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine the number of workers required to complete the job in 4 hours.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nt\\propto\\frac1n \\Rightarrow t=\\frac{k}n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n8=\\frac{k}5 \\Rightarrow k=40\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore t =\\frac{40}n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n4=\\frac{40}n \\Rightarrow n=10\\text{ workers}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>The rate of reaction, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\" data-display=\"false\"></span> mol/s, of a certain chemical reaction is directly proportional to the concentration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> mol/L of a reactant. It is given that when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=0.5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine the concentration that will give a reaction rate of 6 mol/s.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nR\\propto C \\Rightarrow R=kC\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2=k\\times0.5 \\Rightarrow k=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore R =4C\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n6=4C \\Rightarrow C=1.5\\text{ mol/L}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>The intensity of light, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lumens, from a light source is inversely proportional to the square of the distance <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres from the source. It is given that when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I=400\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine the distance that will give a light intensity of 100 lumens.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI\\propto\\frac1{d^2} \\Rightarrow I=\\frac{k}{d^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n400=\\frac{k}{2^2} \\Rightarrow k=1600\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore I =\\frac{1600}{d^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n100=\\frac{1600}{d^2} \\Rightarrow d^2=16\\Rightarrow d=4\\text{ metres}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.17-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is directly proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is inversely proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\frac1{16}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny\\propto x^{\\frac12} \\Rightarrow y=ax^{\\frac12}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nz\\propto\\frac1{y^{10}} \\Rightarrow z=\\frac{b}{y^{10}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore z=\\frac{b}{(ax^{\\frac12})^{10}} \\Rightarrow z=\\frac{b}{a^{10}x^5}\\Rightarrow z=\\frac{k}{x^5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2=\\frac{k}{4^5} \\Rightarrow k=2048\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore z =\\frac{2048}{x^5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{16}=\\frac{2048}{x^5} \\Rightarrow x^5=32768\\Rightarrow x=8\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]